OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAfter a dry start, with local
OL,6,Ffrost, cloud will thicken from the
OL,7,Fnorthwest through the morning.
OL,8,FOutbreaks of rain will then spread
OL,9,Fsoutheast, becoming heavy and
OL,10,Fpersistent during the afternoon in
OL,11,Fplaces. Chilly, with a gentle breeze.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloudy, wet and windy
OL,14,Ftonight, with outbreaks of rain.
OL,15,FBecoming cold, with frost developing
OL,16,Facross western parts and over higher
OL,17,Fground. Risk of icy stretches on
OL,18,Funtreated surfaces.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
